tools.description:
A Vale style-package that flags the tells of AI-written and spec-grade prose, so you can recast them in your own voice before you ship.
Modern writing tools make it easy to produce text that reads like a machine wrote it. That prose has a fingerprint: the em dash, the epigram (is the hero, not a decoration
), the antithesis flourish (reads as discipline, never confession
), the virtue tag (done ri
